h","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:934787c3f9eb9b796a22d880c51abe65d48e2e8f9d61517380f9e4dffac9663f","file":"preprints/A-dimension-free-logarithmic-Sobolev-inequality-for-subgaussian-log-concave-measures-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":26,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"2ae6b185b242b94e8c3535d9d13f1f73d0c8645de9a4856d4aadb5df2bdb971b","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-dimension-free-logarithmic-Sobolev-inequality-for-subgaussian-log-concave-measures-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:934787c3f9eb9b796a22d880c51abe65d48e2e8f9d61517380f9e4dffac9663f","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-dimension-free-logarithmic-Sobolev-inequality-for-subgaussian-log-concave-measures-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L26"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThere is an absolute constant \\(C<\\infty\\) with the following property.\nFor every \\(n\\ge1\\), every centered log-concave probability measure\n\\(\\mu\\) with a Lebesgue density on \\(\\R^n\\), and every \\(a>0\\)\nsatisfying \\eqref{eq:intro-subgaussian} for \\(X\\sim\\mu\\),\n\\[\n \\Ent_\\mu(f^2)\\le C a^2\\int_{\\R^n}|Df|^2\\,d\\mu\n \\qquad\\text{for every }f\\in C_c^\\infty(\\R^n).\n\\]\nThe same constant works in every dimension."}
